		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 5 · 2 Actions · Range 8 · Wall 6 · Concentration: Up to 1 minute.</strong></p><p>Pick a side of the wall. <strong>Damage:</strong> 4d10, once per turn, when creatures enter a space adjacent to that side or pass through the wall. On damage: inflict Smoldering. The wall obstructs vision.</p>",
